WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.831
A wooden mixing bowl holds flour on a white countertop. A cook in a striped shirt and black apron stands behind it.

2
00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:50.879
The cook poured water from a glass pitcher into the flour, mixed it by hand, and kneaded the mixture with a gloved hand.

3
00:00:53.883 --> 00:01:02.266
A second person holds a small white dish and a spoon above the wooden mixing bowl.

4
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:43.120
The cook kneaded the dough smooth, moved it to a floured silicone mat, divided it with a knife, and rolled the portions into balls.

5
00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:16.200
The cook pressed a dough ball flat and rolled it into a long, thin oval with a wooden pin. More flour was spread over the dough.

6
00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:40.070
The cook rolled the long strip into a thin rope, then coiled it into a spiral and pressed the end down.

7
00:03:04.757 --> 00:03:21.162
The dough coils were placed in a brown bowl and covered with a white plate to rest. The plate was lifted, and one coil was placed on the floured mat and rolled into a disc.

8
00:03:33.854 --> 00:03:48.657
The cook rolled the dough back and forth into a larger round, flipped it over, and continued rolling it thinner. The clip ends while the dough is still being rolled.
